WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.438
The first check is the
request, findings one to nine.

2
00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:08.113
A request has to be approved in SailPoint
and carry a ServiceNow change record.

3
00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:10.288
The name has to follow the name standard.

4
00:00:10.288 --> 00:00:15.225
It needs exactly two owners, and a
federal-employee sponsor who isn't one of them.

5
00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:19.062
A group managed account needs its
hosts group, named for the app.

6
00:00:19.062 --> 00:00:22.174
The service principal names
have to match the request.

7
00:00:22.174 --> 00:00:25.025
A delegated managed
account has to be run by

8
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.875
a person and supersede
an existing account.

9
00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:31.700
And the workload, type and risk
tier must be known values.
